      "fields": {
        "compFeatures-wRichText-data-styledText-text": "<p class=\"font_9\" style=\"font-size:19px; text-align:right\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:19px\">At NAVARIS BOATS, we are dedicated to building high-grade boats ranging from 4.8m to 10.5m. Engineered with Marine Grade 5083 5mm aluminum, heavy-duty Achilles Hypalon, and reinforced deep-V hulls, every vessel is the result of three generations of hands-on sea testing and continuous refinement. Driven by unbeatable value and uncompromising build quality, our mission is to elevate your on-water capability. Proudly designed and based in the port of Ploče, Croatia.</span></span></p>"
      }
    },
    {
      "entityId": "comp-mvqx9ixr",
      "schemaId": "181ccb6b-dfb5-4b18-aacc-eadac190f94b",
      "parentEntityId": "sbj2r",
      "publishStatus": "UNPUBLISHED",
      "updatedDate": "2026-11-05T19:51:27.466Z",
      "fields": {
        "compFeatures-wRichText-data-styledText-text": "<h2 class=\"font_4\" style=\"font-size:45px; line-height:1.25em; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:45px\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal\">MASTERED<br> <br> <span style=\"color:#E33B08\">CRAFTSMANSHIP.</span></span></span></h2>"
      }
    },
    {
      "entityId": "comp-mvr7gpdn",
      "schemaId": "181ccb6b-dfb5-4b18-aacc-eadac190f94b",
      "parentEntityId": "sbj2r",
      "publishStatus": "UNPUBLISHED",
      "updatedDate": "2026-11-05T19:51:27.466Z",
      "fields": {
        "compFeatures-wRichText-data-styledText-text": "<h2 class=\"font_4\" style=\"font-size:45px; line-height:1.25em; text-align:right\"><span style=\"font-size:45px\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal\">ADRIATIC TESTED<br> <br> <span style=\"color:#E33B08\">MLJET &amp; LASTOVO.</span></span></span></h2>"
      }
    },
    {
      "entityId": "comp-mvr7gzsz",
      "schemaId": "181ccb6b-dfb5-4b18-aacc-eadac190f94b",
      "parentEntityId": "sbj2r",
      "publishStatus": "UNPUBLISHED",
      "updatedDate": "2026-11-05T19:51:27.466Z",
      "fields": {
        "compFeatures-wRichText-data-styledText-text": "<p class=\"font_9\" style=\"font-size:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:19px\">The open waters surrounding Mljet and Lastovo are world-famous for their beauty, but infamous for punishing afternoon swells and relentless chop. That is our backyard and our testing laboratory.</span></p> \n<p class=\"font_9\" style=\"font-size:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:19px\"><span>​</span></span></p> \n<p class=\"font_9\" style=\"font-size:19px\"><span style=\"font-size:19px\">Running our own rental fleet gives us a rare engineering edge: we see firsthand how hulls, tubes, and hardware endure under real commercial workloads. Every NAVARIS model undergoes extensive offshore sea trials to eliminate weak points, perfect hull geometry, and guarantee a bone-dry, fuel-efficient ride.</span></p>"
      }
    },
    {
      "entityId": "comp-mvr7sovk",
      "schemaId": "181ccb6b-dfb5-4b18-aacc-eadac190f94b",
      "parentEntityId": "sbj2r",
      "publishStatus": "UNPUBLISHED",
      "updatedDate": "2026-11-05T19:51:27.466Z",
      "fields": {
        "compFeatures-wRichText-data-styledText-text": "<h2 class=\"font_4\" style=\"font-size:45px; line-height:1.25em\"><span style=\"font-size:45px\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal\">CHARTER READY<br> <br> <span style=\"color: rgb(227, 59, 8);\">BUILT TO LAST.</span></span></span></h2>"
      }
    },
    {
      "entityId": "comp-mvr7svfk",
      "schemaId": "181ccb6b-dfb5-4b18-aacc-eadac190f94b",
      "parentEntityId": "sbj2r",
      "publishStatus": "UNPUBLISHED",
      "updatedDate": "2026-11-05T19:51:27.466Z",
      "fields": {
        "compFeatures-wRichText-data-styledText-text": "<p class=\"font_9\" style=\"font-size:19px; text-align:right\"><span style=\"font-size:19px\">Commercial-Grade Reliability: Structural stringer reinforcement, 316 stainless steel hardware, and tinned, accessible marine wiring—purpose-built for intense duty cycles, rapid port turnarounds, and zero operational downtime.</span></p> \n<p class=\"font_9\" style=\"font-size:19px; text-align:right\"><span style=\"font-size:19px\"><span>​</span></span></p> \n<p class=\"font_9\" style=\"font-size:19px; text-align:right\"><span style=\"font-size:19px\">Turnkey Fleet Deployment: Delivered water-ready and fully commissioned—rigged with matched outboard propulsion, marine electronics, complete offshore safety arrays, mooring kits and UV sun protection to generate revenue from day one.</span></p> \n<p class=\"font_9\" style=\"font-size:19px; text-align:right\"><span style=\"font-size:19px\"><span>​</span></span></p> \n<p class=\"font_9\" style=\"font-size:19px; text-align:right\"><span style=\"font-size:19px\">Offshore Ergonomics &amp; Guest Safety: Intelligent deck architecture featuring expansive sun loungers, generous deep-storage compartments, and high protective freeboards engineered for total passenger confidence.</span></p>"
      }
    },
    {
      "entityId": "comp-mvzglzec",
      "schemaId": "181ccb6b-dfb5-4b18-aacc-eadac190f94b",
      "parentEntityId": "sbj2r",
      "publishStatus": "UNPUBLISHED",
      "updatedDate": "2026-11-05T19:51:27.466Z",
      "fields": {
        "compFeatures-wRichText-data-styledText-text": "<h4 class=\"font_4\" style=\"font-size:45px; text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:45px\">CHARTER FLEET PARTNERSHIP<br> <span style=\"color:#E33B08\">EARN 25% REVENUE. ZERO INVESTMENT.</span></span></h4>"
      }
    },
    {
      "entityId": "comp-mvzglzef",
      "schemaId": "181ccb6b-dfb5-4b18-aacc-eadac190f94b",
      "parentEntityId": "sbj2r",
      "publishStatus": "UNPUBLISHED",
      "updatedDate": "2026-11-05T19:51:27.466Z",
      "fields": {
        "compFeatures-wRichText-data-styledText-text": "<p class=\"font_8\" style=\"font-size:18px; line-height:1.8em; text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Expand your rental fleet without buying new vessels. We supply a brand-new NAVARIS boat and the complete digital booking infrastructure—you manage local guest operations and take home 25% of the net revenue.</span></p>"
      }
    },
    {
      "entityId": "comp-mvzglzek",
      "schemaId": "181ccb6b-dfb5-4b18-aacc-eadac190f94b",
      "parentEntityId": "sbj2r",
      "publishStatus": "UNPUBLISHED",
      "updatedDate": "2026-11-05T19:51:27.466Z",
      "fields": {
